/T (On May 4th 2024, the students of third year ECE hosted a farewell party for the Final year ECE students. The event was inaugurated by the Head of The Department, Dr. Dayananda G K and the Former Principal Dr. Ganesh V Bhat in the presence of the Department Faculty. This was followed by the cultural performances. Also, some games such as saree draping, identifying childhood pictures, Mr and Ms Farewell etc were organized to engage each and every one)
/E (On May 4th 2024, the students of third year ECE hosted a farewell party for the Final year ECE students. The event was inaugurated by the Head of The Department, Dr. Dayananda G K and the Former Principal Dr. Ganesh V Bhat in the presence of the Department Faculty. This was followed by the cultural performances. Also, some games such as saree draping, identifying childhood pictures, Mr and Ms Farewell etc were organized to engage each and every one)
/Pg 19 0 R
