/T (This workshop series covered the basics of Android app development, including user interface design, database management, and app deployment. Participants engaged in hands-on coding sessions, creating their own apps under the guidance of experienced instructors. The workshop also included sessions on debugging and performance optimization, ensuring that students gained a comprehensive understanding of the app development process.)
